    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76789" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλαίστρα</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλαίω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wrestling-school</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρόμον καὶ π. ποιησάμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.126
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				4
			</span></i>: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				528
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				729
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς παλαίστραν φοιτῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					456d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέμπουσιν εἰς διδασκάλων μαθησομένους
					καὶ γράμματα καὶ μουσικὴν καὶ τὰ ἐν παλαίστρᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Lac.</u>
					2.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κερκυόνος π.</span>, of the spot where
			Cercyon slew his victims, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				17.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.39.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>school</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Ἀλεξάνδρου π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Demetr.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Σωκράτους π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					4.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
